WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:03.920
How do you do?

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.630
My name's Masa.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:08.133
I'm Boss Tatsu's sworn brother.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.760
Oh, so you're Masa!

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.721
Nice to meet you, I'm Miku.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.974
Sorry I didn't tell you in advance,
but I came today for Boss's…

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.851
-Birthday!
-Birthday!

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:21.479
Tacchan's out for shopping
and the Neighborhood Association meeting.

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:23.189
He won't be back until the evening.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:28.903
So I've been preparing the decorations
and the cake as a surprise!

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.241
All right. Perfect!

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:35.827
I'd be happy to help, Boss Lady!

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.871
Really? That'd be great!

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.457
I was just slicing
some fruit for the cake.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:41.875
CHOP

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:43.126
Wait, Boss Lady…

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:45.128
Let me do it.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.504
Are you sure?

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:54.429
So slow!
You gotta be faster and really whack 'em!

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.473
Hold on, let's guugle it first.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:01.519
Hey!

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.146
KER-CHAK

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.607
I'm home… Huh?

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.527
What the hell happened?

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:11.738
LEAN, PULL, POP

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:17.452
We screwed up.

00:01:17.994 --> 00:01:20.205
So that's what went down, eh?

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:23.708
I'll avenge you!

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.796
Amazing as usual, Tacchan!

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:29.214
You nailed it, Boss!

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:41.518
Happy birthday dear me

